sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Guards as Guards and<br/>ReportsController
    participant Scope as ReportScopeService
    participant Engine as ReportsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Owner->>Web: Open a report, pick period, location scope, filters
    Web->>API: GET /reports/:key with from, to, scope, basis, doctorId
    API->>Guards: JWT, tenant, feature, access checks
    Guards->>Guards: report's own permission - financial or clinical
    Guards->>Scope: resolve reach from the permission's scope
    Scope->>DB: locations of the organization, location timezone
    Scope-->>Engine: location ids, own doctor, clinic-local today
    Engine->>DB: the definition's SQL, paisa, capped at 5,000 rows
    DB-->>Engine: rows
    Engine-->>Web: columns, rows and totals in rupees, summary, notes
    Web-->>Owner: Summary tiles, sortable table, notes
    Owner->>Web: Download, then Excel or PDF
    Web->>API: GET /reports/:key/export?format=xlsx or pdf
    API->>Engine: same run, capped at 50,000 rows
    Engine->>Engine: ExcelJS workbook or pdfmake A4 document
    API->>DB: audit row - action EXPORT, report, format, rows
    API-->>Web: file attachment
    Web-->>Owner: File saved, toast "Excel file downloaded"
